        {
          "@value": "The Kotlin implementation of the HCERT pipeline and Verifiable Health Links, for the JVM (Android as-is) and Node: `hcert-api`, the declarations wit2kotlin generates from the WIT contract, and `hcert-core`, the behaviour (deterministic CBOR, COSE_Sign1 ES256/PS256, ZLIB, Base45, HC1, the trust list, verification, the VHL payload, the ITI-YY5 manifest request and JWE dir/A256GCM). No third-party runtime dependency; every build artefact is pinned in gradle/verification-metadata.xml."
        }
      ],
      "skos:notation": "hcert-kotlin",
      "dcterms:source": "smart-trust-tools/tools/hcert-kotlin/hcert-kotlin.ts#hcert-kotlin",
